      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, very professional. \n\ni just ran it through our preliminary sentiment tool and the score came back a bit lower than we usually like to see for emergency appeals. it's a little... I don't know, dry? i get what i said about not being melodramatic, but we really need these people to feel the weight of what's happening. \n\ncan you try another version? maybe lean a bit more into the emotional side of it—the beauty of what we're losing and the hope for the future—to see if we can get that sentiment score up a bit. just please keep it feeling real and not like a cheap sales pitch.",
      "source": "evaluator"
